Port of the Geometry Wars and Hard Corps local user display names: local_player_1_name .. local_player_4_name set
the name XamUserGetName, XamUserGetGamerTag and XamUserGetSigninInfo return for local users 0..3 (valid UTF-8, no
control characters, at most 15 characters and 15 bytes; otherwise ignored). Users 1..3 only have a name when one is
set. The XUID, the sign-in state and the content directory (UserProfile::profile_id()) never follow the display name.

